  "note": "Independent re-judgment after adding emitPrePolicyAdjRIBOut in reactorAPIAdapter.forwardUpdateSection (reactor_api_forward.go) for RFC 8671 Section 5.2 and unresolvedNextHops withdrawal cleanup in RIBManager.handleReceivedStructured (rib_structured.go, commit 04c75f30c3). Neither change touches attribute parsing, unrecognized transitive optional attribute retention, or Partial bit setting/preservation: emitPrePolicyAdjRIBOut copies sourceWire.Payload() read-only for BMP pre-policy Adj-RIB-Out observation without mutating sourceWire, mods, or the transmitted UPDATE payload; handleReceivedStructured only purges unresolvedNextHops when a peer's RIB empties on withdrawal. All six tagged tests and their positive covers remain unchanged, and the verdict stays weak for the same recorded reason: every tag on RFC4271-5-3 is positive, with neither a negative test nor a {single-polarity} annotation.",
